{
  "version": "shopify_kb_wearbliss_v1",
  "description": "Shopify + Knowledge Base eval cases modelled on the live Wear Bliss store (https://wearbliss.store) — a unisex streetwear shop that ships within India. Exercises the two retrieval dimensions of the web agent: live catalog lookups (`get_products`) and policy/KB grounding (`search_knowledgebase`), plus order status (`get_order_status`). Cases are split into single-turn routing/grounding checks and several multi-turn conversations (shared chat_id, ordered by `sequence`) that mirror how a real shopper drifts between browsing, policy questions, and order tracking. Skill/aide routing (ticket/lead/handoff) is intentionally out of scope here — that lives in the skills_routing datasets.",
  "notes": [
    "All cases point at the shopify_kb_aide staging agent (106f41ee-e09f-4536-8e38-c8178145429a). Repoint before running if your staging agent_id differs. The agent must have Shopify connected to the Wear Bliss store AND a knowledge base loaded with the store's policy pages (shipping, refund, privacy, terms, contact, about) for the KB cases to retrieve real context.",
    "Routing contract (matches web_agent_v1): shopping intent — browse, recommend, price, availability, size — routes to `get_products` only. Policy / terms / privacy / shipping / returns / contact questions route to `search_knowledgebase` only. Order tracking routes to `get_order_status`. Greetings, thanks, and out-of-scope chit-chat call no tool ([]). trajectory_evaluator uses set semantics and penalises extras 0.1 each, so expected_tools is the single correct tool per turn.",
    "Scoring uses the RAG triad + trajectory only (faithfulness, response_relevancy, context_precision, trajectory). The answer_correctness rubric judge has been removed for this use case, so cases carry NO golden_reply field. Product-intent and policy-fact quality is covered by faithfulness (grounding) + response_relevancy (on-topic) + trajectory (right tool).",
    "Facts the KB rubrics are grounded in (from the live policy pages, captured 2026-06): return window 30 days (14 for EU); refunds to original payment method within 10 business days; free prepaid return label; sale items + gift cards non-returnable; exchange = return then re-buy; ships within India only, NO international; processing 1-2 business days; metro delivery 2-4 business days, other regions 4-7; free shipping over Rs.2000; COD carries an extra fee; tracking via email/SMS; report damaged/lost within 48 hours; privacy collects contact/financial/account/device data and shares with Shopify, deletion on request; support email wearbliss@example.com; terms require age of majority and personal (non-resale) use.",
    "Multi-turn flows share one chat_id and run serially by sequence; the runner threads them through the production checkpointer. Pure context-builder or genuinely ambiguous turns are marked score_judges:false so they don't drag judge averages; turns with a clear expected behaviour are scored.",
    "Upload: python -m app.modules.evals.cli upload-dataset --name shopify_kb_wearbliss_v1 --path packages/agent/eval/datasets/shopify_kb_wearbliss_v1.json"
  ],
